1. SCOPE

This license covers all original material in this repository ("the Work"),
including but not limited to:

  - index.html — the game (source code, procedurally drawn graphics, Web Audio
    synthesis, and the embedded synthesized voice clips)
  - build_gamepix.py, verify_smoke.py, gamepix/make_assets.py
  - the generated media in gamepix/assets/
  - the leaderboard backend in server/
  - the documentation (README.md, GAMEPIX_SUBMISSION.md, server/README.md)

The Work is made publicly readable on GitHub for transparency and archival
purposes. Public readability does not grant any right to use the Work.


