5. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The Work contains no bundled third-party code, font data, images or audio
samples. Specifically:

  - The GamePix SDK (https://integration.gamepix.com/sdk/v3/gamepix.sdk.js)
    is loaded at runtime from GamePix's servers and is governed by GamePix's
    own terms. It is not part of this repository and is not redistributed or
    relicensed here.
  - The game icon, cover and screenshots are generated from the Work's own
    canvas rendering; emoji glyphs are rendered by the player's operating
    system and no font data is bundled.
  - The two embedded Chinese voice clips were synthesized locally by the
    Copyright Holder with Windows SAPI (Microsoft Hanhan, zh-TW) and are
    included as base64 PCM data inside index.html.
  - Playwright (Apache-2.0) is used only as a development-time dependency of
    verify_smoke.py and gamepix/make_assets.py. It is not distributed in any
    build of the Work.


